# ── Build artifacts & caches (never commit) ──────────────────────────────────

# XMonad recompilation output
**/xmonad/build-*/
**/xmonad/xmonad-x86_64-linux
**/xmonad/xmonadx86
**/xmonad/xmonad.errors
*.hi
*.o

# cmus runtime cache / library db
**/cmus/music-library
**/cmus/lib.pl
**/cmus/autosave
**/cmus/cache
**/cmus/search-history
**/cmus/command-history

# ── Large media: keep the repo lean ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Multi-GB screen recordings used to bloat history. Keep them out of git;
# host demo clips externally (YouTube / a release asset) and link them.
*.mkv

# ── Editor / torando timestamped backups ────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak.*

# ── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
